6. Billing Calculation

The project uses the following calculations:

Item Amount = Price × Quantity

If the subtotal is ₹500 or more:

Discount = 10% of Subtotal

Then:

GST = 5% of (Subtotal − Discount)

Finally:

Final Bill = Subtotal − Discount + GST

